                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/24/chinas-state-oil-firms-halt-russian-oil-purchases-following-us-sanctions-reuters/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="chinas-state-oil-firms-halt-russian-oil-purchases-following-us-sanctions-reuters">China’s state oil firms halt Russian oil purchases following US sanctions – Reuters</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/27/lukoil-to-sell-international-assets-days-after-us-sanctions-hit-russias-oil-giants/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="lukoil-to-sell-international-assets-days-after-us-sanctions-hit-russias-oil-giants">Lukoil to sell international assets days after US sanctions hit Russia’s oil giants</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                          </ul>
          </div>
      </div>
    
