                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/31/new-zealand-hits-russian-oil-shadow-fleet-with-65-new-sanctions-after-insurer-scandal/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="new-zealand-hits-russian-oil-shadow-fleet-with-65-new-sanctions-after-insurer-scandal">New Zealand hits Russian oil shadow fleet with 65 new sanctions after insurer scandal</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
