		<item>
		<title>Quiz Game: Drone wall strategist</title>
		<link>https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/31/quiz-ukraine-built-europes-drone-wall-but-do-you-know-how-it-actually-works/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Serhii Omelchenko]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 19:16:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Quizzes and Infographics]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://euromaidanpress.com/?p=364834</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[You are in charge of building the EU's Drone Wall. Test your knowledge with this quiz on its technology, tactics, and impact!]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="1024" height="768" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Quiz-Game-Drone-wall-strategist.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" alt="Quiz Game: Drone wall strategist" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Quiz-Game-Drone-wall-strategist.webp 1024w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Quiz-Game-Drone-wall-strategist-300x225.webp 300w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Quiz-Game-Drone-wall-strategist-200x150.webp 200w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Quiz-Game-Drone-wall-strategist-260x195.webp 260w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Quiz-Game-Drone-wall-strategist-380x285.webp 380w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Quiz-Game-Drone-wall-strategist-800x600.webp 800w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p><div data-type="_mgwidget" data-widget-id="1845881"></div>        
        <script>
            (function(w,q){w[q]=w[q]||[];w[q].push(["_mgc.load"])})(window,"_mgq");
        </script>
    <p><strong>This quiz is based on <a target="_blank" href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/if-the-eu-builds-its-drone-wall-how-might-it-actually-look/" rel="noopener">Ukraine already built Europe's "drone wall"—here's how it actually works.</a></strong></p>
<p><strong>Before taking it we recommend to read this original article by euromaidanpress.com.</strong></p>


<!-- START OF CORRECTED AND CLEANED GAME CODE -->
<style>
.ep-game-container{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:700px;margin:20px auto;padding:15px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #e9ecef}.ep-game-container .game-stage{margin-bottom:40px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;display:none}.ep-game-container .game-stage.active{display:block;animation:epq-in .5s ease forwards}@keyframes epq-in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}.ep-game-container h2{font-family:"Georgia",serif;font-size:clamp(20px,5vw,26px);margin-bottom:15px;color:#222;line-height:1.3}.ep-game-container .stage-counter{font-size:clamp(16px,4vw,20px);color:#888;margin-bottom:10px;font-family:"Georgia",serif}.ep-game-container .game-stage img{width:100%;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;height:auto;object-fit:cover;max-height:400px}.ep-game-container .choices-container{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.ep-game-container .choice-option{padding:15px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s;font-size:clamp(16px,4vw,18px);text-align:center;background:#fff;user-select:none}.ep-game-container .choice-option:not(.disabled):hover{background:#f0f0f0;border-color:#aaa;transform:translateY(-2px)}.ep-game-container .choice-option.correct{background:#d4edda!important;border-color:#28a745!important;color:#155724;font-weight:700}.ep-game-container .choice-option.incorrect{background:#f8d7da!important;border-color:#dc3545!important;color:#721c24;font-weight:700}.ep-game-container .choice-option.disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.7;transform:none!important}.ep-game-container .feedback{margin-top:15px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:clamp(14px,3.5vw,16px);background:#f7f7f7;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;display:none;line-height:1.5}#game-results{text-align:center;padding:20px;display:none}.ep-game-container #game-results.active{display:block;animation:epq-in .5s ease forwards}.ep-game-container #game-results h2{font-family:"Georgia",serif;font-size:clamp(24px,5vw,32px);color:#222}.ep-game-container #game-results p{font-size:clamp(16px,4vw,20px);color:#555;margin:10px 0 20px}.ep-game-container #game-results img{max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-top:20px;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover}.ep-game-container #restart-game-btn{margin-top:20px;padding:14px 25px;font-size:clamp(16px,4vw,18px);cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;border:none;background:#007bff;color:#fff}.ep-game-container #restart-game-btn:hover{background:#0056b3}#game-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px}.ep-game-container #start-game-btn{margin-top:20px;padding:14px 25px;font-size:clamp(16px,4vw,18px);cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;border:none;background:#28a745;color:#fff}.ep-game-container #start-game-btn:hover{background:#218838}.game-share{margin-top:30px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #eee}.ep-game-container .game-share p{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;color:#333}.share-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px}.share-btn{flex:1 1 100px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 24px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .25s;min-width:140px;text-decoration:none;color:#fff}.share-btn:hover{opacity:.85}.share-btn.share-native{background-color:#20c997}.share-btn.copy-link{background-color:#6c5ce7}#copy-feedback{margin-top:10px;text-align:center;color:#28a745;font-weight:700;display:none}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ep-game-container{background:#2d2d2d;border-color:#444}.ep-game-container .game-stage{border-bottom-color:#444}.ep-game-container h2,.ep-game-container .game-share p{color:#f1f1f1}.ep-game-container .stage-counter,.ep-game-container #game-results p{color:#a0a0a0}.ep-game-container .choice-option{background:#3e3e3e;color:#f1f1f1;border-color:#555}.ep-game-container .choice-option:not(.disabled):hover{background:#505050;border-color:#777}.ep-game-container .feedback{background:#3e3e3e;border-color:#555;color:#f1f1f1}.ep-game-container .choice-option.correct{background-color:#1e4620!important;border-color:#388e3c!important;color:#c8e6c9!important}.ep-game-container .choice-option.incorrect{background-color:#592125!important;border-color:#c62828!important;color:#ffcdd2!important}.ep-game-container .game-share{border-top-color:#444}}
</style><div data-fuse="incontent_1"></div>
<div class="ep-game-container" id="drone-wall-game">
  <!-- Intro Screen -->
  <div id="game-intro" class="game-stage">
    <h2 id="become-a-drone-wall-strategist">Become a Drone Wall Strategist</h2>
    <img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/quizwall.webp" alt="A strategic map with military figures">
    <p>You are in charge of building the EU's Drone Wall. Your mission: defend the border against incoming threats. Make the right choices based on real-world intelligence.</p>
    <button id="start-game-btn">Start Mission</button>
  </div>
  <!-- Stage 1 -->
  <div class="game-stage" data-stage="1">
    <p class="stage-counter">Stage 1 of 5: The Master Plan</p>
    <h2 id="the-council-asks-for-your-grand-design-what-kind-of-wall-will-you-build">The council asks for your grand design. What kind of "wall" will you build?</h2>
    <img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/drones-wall.webp" alt="What kind of 'wall' will you build?">
    <div class="choices-container">
      <div class="choice-option" data-correct="true">A network of sensors and countermeasures</div>
      <div class="choice-option">A physical wall with barbed wire</div>
      <div class="choice-option">A line of automated turrets</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-correct"><strong>Excellent choice!</strong> A "virtual" wall of integrated sensors is the modern, flexible approach.</div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-incorrect"><strong>Mission Compromised!</strong> A physical wall is outdated. The correct strategy is a network of sensors.</div>
  </div>
  <!-- Stage 2 -->
  <div class="game-stage" data-stage="2">
    <p class="stage-counter">Stage 2 of 5: Countermeasure</p>
    <h2 id="enemy-drones-are-detected-what-is-your-primary-countermeasure-based-on-proven-ukrainian-tactics">Enemy drones are detected! What is your primary countermeasure, based on proven Ukrainian tactics?</h2>
    <img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/An-electronic-circuit-board-repr.webp" alt="An electronic circuit board representing electronic warfare">
    <div class="choices-container">
      <div class="choice-option">Large nets</div>
      <div class="choice-option">Trained eagles</div>
      <div class="choice-option" data-correct="true">Electronic warfare (jamming)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-correct"><strong>Strategic move!</strong> Jamming is a key, cost-effective lesson from Ukraine's defense.</div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-incorrect"><strong>Ineffective!</strong> While other methods exist, electronic warfare is the proven primary tactic.</div>
  </div>
  <!-- Stage 3 -->
  <div class="game-stage" data-stage="3">
    <p class="stage-counter">Stage 3 of 5: Integration</p>
    <h2 id="your-allies-offer-different-systems-from-various-countries-what-is-your-biggest-logistical-challenge">Your allies offer different systems from various countries. What is your biggest logistical challenge?</h2>
    <img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/A-complex-puzzle-with-one-missin.webp" alt="A complex puzzle with one missing piece">
    <div class="choices-container">
      <div class="choice-option" data-correct="true">Integrating all the different systems</div>
      <div class="choice-option">Translating the instruction manuals</div>
      <div class="choice-option">Finding enough electricity sockets</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-correct"><strong>Well spotted!</strong> Making disparate systems work together as one is a huge technological hurdle.</div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-incorrect"><strong>Wrong focus!</strong> The main challenge is getting all the different technologies to communicate and integrate.</div>
  </div>
  <!-- Stage 4 -->
  <div class="game-stage" data-stage="4">
    <p class="stage-counter">Stage 4 of 5: The Budget</p>
    <h2 id="the-project-needs-funding-what-is-the-realistic-budget-you-request-from-the-eu-for-this-project">The project needs funding. What is the realistic budget you request from the EU for this project?</h2>
    <img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Stacks-of-Euro-banknotes.webp" alt="Stacks of Euro banknotes">
    <div class="choices-container">
      <div class="choice-option">€2.5 million</div>
      <div class="choice-option" data-correct="true">€2.5 billion</div>
      <div class="choice-option">€2.5 trillion</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-correct"><strong>Budget approved!</strong> The estimated cost is indeed a substantial €2.5 billion.</div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-incorrect"><strong>Request denied!</strong> That's not the right figure. The estimated cost is €2.5 billion.</div>
  </div>
  <!-- Stage 5 -->
  <div class="game-stage" data-stage="5">
    <p class="stage-counter">Stage 5 of 5: The Final Threat</p>
    <h2 id="a-massive-drone-swarm-is-approaching-what-is-the-first-and-most-critical-component-of-your-defense">A massive drone swarm is approaching! What is the first and most critical component of your defense?</h2>
    <img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Dark-stormy-clouds-with-a-radar.webp" alt="Dark, stormy clouds with a radar dish representing detection">
    <div class="choices-container">
      <div class="choice-option">Physical interception</div>
      <div class="choice-option">Waiting for orders</div>
      <div class="choice-option" data-correct="true">Early detection</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-correct"><strong>Threat neutralized!</strong> You can't stop what you can't see. Early detection is paramount.</div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-incorrect">**Too late!** The first step is always early detection to prepare a response.</div>
  </div>
  <!-- Results -->
  <div id="game-results" class="game-stage">
    <h2 id="results-title"><span id=""></span></h2>
    <p id="results-text"></p>
    <img decoding="async" id="results-image" src="" alt="Game result image">
    <button id="restart-game-btn">Play Again</button>
    <!-- SHARE BLOCK -->
    <div class="game-share">
      <p>Share your rank!</p>
      <div class="share-row">
        <button id="game-native-share-btn" class="share-btn share-native" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 512 512" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M503.691 189.836L327.495 13.639c-15.172-15.172-39.781-15.172-54.953 0s-15.172 39.781 0 54.953l93.678 93.678H192.001c-106.039 0-192 85.961-192 192v64c0 21.213 17.787 39.999 39.999 39.999 22.213 0 39.999-17.787 39.999-39.999v-64c0-61.758 50.242-111.999 111.999-111.999h174.219l-93.678 93.678c-15.172 15.172-15.172 39.781 0 54.953 7.586 7.586 17.522 11.379 27.477 11.379s19.891-3.793 27.477-11.379l176.196-176.197c-15.172-15.172-15.172-39.781-.001-54.953z"></path></svg>Share</button>
        <button id="game-copy-link-btn" class="share-btn copy-link" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 512 512" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M288 448H64V224h64V160H64c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64V448c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64H288c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V384H288v64zm-64-288H448V64H224v64zm224-64H224c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64V288c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64H448c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V64c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64z"></path></svg>Copy link</button>
      </div>
      <div id="copy-feedback" class="copy-feedback">Link copied to clipboard!</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const container = document.getElementById('drone-wall-game');
    if (!container) return;
    let score = 0;
    let currentStageIndex = 0;
    const allStages = Array.from(container.querySelectorAll('.game-stage'));
    const questionStages = Array.from(container.querySelectorAll('.game-stage[data-stage]'));
    const totalQuestions = questionStages.length;
    const introBlock = container.querySelector('#game-intro');
    const resultsBlock = container.querySelector('#game-results');
    function showStage(index) {
        allStages.forEach(stage => stage.classList.remove('active'));
        const stageToShow = allStages[index];
        if (stageToShow) {
            stageToShow.classList.add('active');
            if (stageToShow.scrollIntoView) {
                stageToShow.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
            }
        }
    }
    function handleChoice(selectedOption) {
        const stage = selectedOption.closest('.game-stage');
        if (!stage || stage.dataset.answered === 'true') return;
        stage.dataset.answered = 'true';
        const isCorrect = selectedOption.dataset.correct === 'true';
        stage.querySelectorAll('.choice-option').forEach(opt => opt.classList.add('disabled'));
        if (isCorrect) {
            score++;
            selectedOption.classList.add('correct');
            stage.querySelector('.feedback-correct').style.display = 'block';
        } else {
            selectedOption.classList.add('incorrect');
            stage.querySelector('[data-correct="true"]').classList.add('correct');
            stage.querySelector('.feedback-incorrect').style.display = 'block';
        }
        setTimeout(() => {
            currentStageIndex++;
            if (currentStageIndex <= totalQuestions) {
                showStage(currentStageIndex);
            } else {
                showResults();
            }
        }, 2500);
    }
    function showResults() {
        showStage(allStages.indexOf(resultsBlock));
        const title = resultsBlock.querySelector('#results-title');
        const text = resultsBlock.querySelector('#results-text');
        const img = resultsBlock.querySelector('#results-image');
        let resultText = `You made ${score} out of ${totalQuestions} correct decisions!`;
        if (score <= 2) {
            title.textContent = 'Border Breached!';
            img.src = 'https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/quizwall2.webp';
            img.alt = 'A single drone in a red-lit sky.';
            resultText += " The drones got through. Time to study the intelligence reports again.";
        } else if (score <= 4) {
            title.textContent = 'Border Secured!';
            img.src = 'https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/quizwall.webp';
            img.alt = 'A person operating a drone controller.';
            resultText += " Your strategy was effective, but there's room for improvement.";
        } else {
            title.textContent = 'Fortress Europe!';
            img.src = 'https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/quizwall1.webp';
            img.alt = 'Multiple drones flying in formation.';
            resultText += " You are a true Drone Wall Strategist. The border is safe under your command.";
        }
        text.textContent = resultText;
        updateShareLinks(score, totalQuestions);
    }
    function updateShareLinks(score, total) {
        // Share logic doesn't need changes, but it's part of the game.
    }
    function initGame() {
        score = 0;
        currentStageIndex = 0;
        allStages.forEach(stage => {
            delete stage.dataset.answered;
            stage.querySelectorAll('.choice-option').forEach(opt => opt.classList.remove('correct', 'incorrect', 'disabled'));
            stage.querySelectorAll('.feedback').forEach(f => f.style.display = 'none');
        });
        showStage(currentStageIndex); // Show intro
    }
    // Use a single event listener for the whole container
    container.addEventListener('click', function(event) {
        const target = event.target;
        if (target.id === 'start-game-btn') {
            currentStageIndex = 1; // Move to the first question
            showStage(currentStageIndex);
        } else if (target.id === 'restart-game-btn') {
            initGame();
        } else if (target.classList.contains('choice-option') && !target.classList.contains('disabled')) {
            handleChoice(target);
        }
    });
    // Share button logic
    const shareContainer = container.querySelector('.game-share');
    if (shareContainer) {
        const nativeBtn = shareContainer.querySelector('#game-native-share-btn');
        const copyBtn = shareContainer.querySelector('#game-copy-link-btn');
        const copyFeedback = shareContainer.querySelector('#copy-feedback');
        if (navigator.share && nativeBtn) {
            nativeBtn.style.display = 'inline-flex';
        } else if (nativeBtn) {
            nativeBtn.style.display = 'none';
        }
        if (copyBtn) {
            const originalText = copyBtn.innerHTML;
            copyBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const gameTitle = "EU's Drone Wall Strategist Game";
                const resultTitle = resultsBlock.querySelector('#results-title').textContent;
                const shareText = `I got the rank of "${resultTitle}" in the ${gameTitle}! I made ${score}/${totalQuestions} correct decisions. Can you do better?`;
                const pageUrl = window.location.href;
                navigator.clipboard.writeText(shareText + '\n\n' + pageUrl).then(() => {
                    if (copyFeedback) copyFeedback.style.display = 'block';
                    copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied!';
                    setTimeout(() => {
                        if (copyFeedback) copyFeedback.style.display = 'none';
                        copyBtn.innerHTML = originalText;
                    }, 2000);
                });
            });
        }
        if (nativeBtn && navigator.share) {
             nativeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const gameTitle = "EU's Drone Wall Strategist Game";
                const resultTitle = resultsBlock.querySelector('#results-title').textContent;
                const shareText = `I got the rank of "${resultTitle}" in the ${gameTitle}! I made ${score}/${totalQuestions} correct decisions. Can you do better?`;
                const pageUrl = window.location.href;
                navigator.share({ title: gameTitle, text: shareText, url: pageUrl }).catch(console.error);
            });
        }
    }
    initGame();
});
</script>
