                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/31/neptune-missiles-hit-russian-energy-hubs-in-bryansk-and-oryol-oblasts/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="neptune-missiles-hit-russian-energy-hubs-in-bryansk-and-oryol-oblasts-ukrainian-navy">Neptune missiles hit Russian energy hubs in Bryansk and Oryol Oblasts – Ukrainian Navy</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/31/strikes-on-russian-refineries-cut-oil-output-by-90/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="kinetic-sanctions-160-strikes-on-russian-refineries-in-2025-cut-oil-output-by-90-sbu-chief">“Kinetic sanctions”: 160 strikes on Russian refineries in 2025 cut oil output by 90% – SBU chief</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                          </ul>
          </div>
