			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Orbán says Hungary will seek exemption from US sanctions that hit Russian giants Rosneft and Lukoil</title>
		<link>https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/31/orban-says-hungary-will-seek-exemption-from-us-sanctions-that-hit-russian-giants-rosneft-and-lukoil/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Yuri Zoria]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 18:32:08 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Latest news Ukraine]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[exemption]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Hungary]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[lukoil]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Orban]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Rosneft]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Sanctions against Russia]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[US sanctions]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://euromaidanpress.com/?p=370881</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[The Hungarian Prime Minister claims his pipeline‑dependent country deserves a US exemption, citing Germany’s earlier waiver.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="1024" height="685" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/photo_5206429849965682179_y.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" alt="orbán says hungary ask trump lift oil sanctions hit russian giants rosneft lukoil · post hungarian pm victor president vladimir putin moscow 5 2024 ria novosti orban meets handler prime" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/photo_5206429849965682179_y.jpg 1024w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/photo_5206429849965682179_y-300x201.jpg 300w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/photo_5206429849965682179_y-380x254.jpg 380w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/photo_5206429849965682179_y-800x535.jpg 800w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p><div data-type="_mgwidget" data-widget-id="1845881"></div>        
        <script>
            (function(w,q){w[q]=w[q]||[];w[q].push(["_mgc.load"])})(window,"_mgq");
        </script>
    <p>Hungarian Prime Minister Viktor Orbán plans to ask US President Donald Trump to exempt Hungary from new American sanctions targeting Russian oil. The meeting is set for 7 November and will be the first bilateral talks between Orbán and Trump since the latter’s return to the White House, Reuters <a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/hungarys-orban-says-will-seek-exemption-us-oil-sanctions-2025-10-31/">reports</a>.</p>
<div class="pk-content-block pk-block-bg pk-block-bg-light" data-start="371" data-end="675">Orbán’s current push follows his <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/24/sanction-me-softly-trump-orban-and-the-oil-that-binds-them/">previous statement</a> that Hungary is “working on how to circumvent” the US sanctions Trump had imposed days ago against Russia's Rosneft and Lukoil, selling oil to Hungary. While Ukraine continues to fight Russia’s invasion, Hungary remains aligned with Moscow, taking part in financing the war by continuing to purchase Russian oil.</div>
<h3 id="orban-says-hungary-needs-a-waiver-due-to-geography-and-energy-reliance" data-start="677" data-end="751">Orbán says Hungary needs a waiver due to geography and energy reliance</h3>
<p data-start="753" data-end="1293">Orbán announced that he will seek relief from the latest US sanctions imposed on Russian oil companies Rosneft and Lukoil. According to him, Hungary’s energy dependence and lack of sea access make it uniquely vulnerable.</p><div data-fuse="incontent_1"></div>
<blockquote>
<p data-start="753" data-end="1293">“<em>Hungary is a landlocked country... We are dependent on those transport routes through which energy can reach Hungary. These are mostly pipelines,</em>” Orbán said. “<em>We have to make the Americans understand this peculiar situation... if we want them to allow exemptions from the American sanctions against Russia,”</em> he added.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1295" data-end="1810">The US sanctions came just days after a fire broke out at the main Danube refinery owned by Hungarian oil group MOL, forcing the plant to operate at reduced capacity, further threatening Hungary’s already fragile fuel situation.</p>
<h3 id="orban-invokes-germanys-exemption-as-a-precedent" data-start="1812" data-end="1864">Orbán invokes Germany’s exemption as a precedent</h3>
<p data-start="1866" data-end="2255">Orbán also cited Germany’s case as justification for Hungary’s request. Berlin had previously secured an exemption from US sanctions for the German assets of Rosneft, which owns a controlling stake in the Schwedt refinery. Reuters reports that Germany’s economy minister confirmed on 29 October that Washington granted the exemption because the refinery is no longer under Russian control.</p>

          <div class="read-also">
          <div class="read-also__inner">
                          <h2 id="read-also" class="read-also__headline">
                Read also              </h2>
                        
            <ul class="read-also__list">
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/23/trump-finally-acts-after-months-of-hesitation-russias-rosneft-and-lukoil-now-sanctioned/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="trump-finally-acts-after-months-of-hesitation-russias-rosneft-and-lukoil-now-sanctioned">Trump finally acts after months of hesitation — Russia’s Rosneft and Lukoil now sanctioned</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/28/hungary-plots-anti-ukraine-axis-with-slovakia-and-czechia-within-the-eu/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="hungary-plots-anti-ukraine-axis-with-slovakia-and-czechia-within-the-eu">Hungary plots anti-Ukraine axis with Slovakia and Czechia within the EU</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/18/hungary-vows-putin-honored-guest-treatment-for-trump-talks-despite-legal-duty-to-arrest-him/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="hungary-vows-putin-honored-guest-treatment-for-trump-talks-despite-legal-duty-to-arrest-him">Hungary vows Putin honored guest treatment for Trump talks despite legal duty to arrest him</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                          </ul>
          </div>
      </div>
    
        <div data-type="_mgwidget" data-widget-id="1805850"></div>
        <script>
